      "id": "claim_52e13ec86e9845e0b46b7c35f0d50bc8",
      "statement": "_render_markdown() pipes every rendered Markdown preview through sanitize_html(), which uses the nh3 (Rust/ammonia) library with an explicit tag/attribute allowlist that never permits on* event-handler attributes or inline style for any tag, restricts href/src URL schemes to http/https/mailto, and lets nh3's own exceptions propagate rather than silently falling back to unsanitized output.",
